---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="HVAC Boot Camp Pricing | Pay in Full or Monthly"
  description="Compare HVAC Boot Camp payment options: $479 paid in full or $97 to start plus six monthly payments. Both include the complete course and instructor support."
>
  <div class="standard-page pricing-page">
    <section class="page-hero pricing-hero">
      <div class="page-hero-inner narrow-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Straightforward pricing</p>
        <h1>One complete course. <span>Two ways to pay.</span></h1>
        <p>Choose the lower total price or spread out the cost. The course, instructor support, career preparation, and 30-day satisfaction promise are the same.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section pricing-main-section">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <div class="pricing-grid pricing-grid-light">
          <article class="price-card featured">
            <p class="price-badge">Best value</p>
            <p class="price-label">Pay in full</p>
            <p class="price">$479</p>
            <p class="price-detail">One payment. Save $200 compared with the monthly plan.</p>
            <ul class="price-list"><li>Complete 27-module Boot Camp</li><li>Instructor support</li><li>Focused learning assistance</li><li>Job-search and interview preparation</li><li>OJT planning</li><li>30-day satisfaction promise</li></ul>
            <a class="button button-primary" href="https://www.hvactrainingsolutions.net/hvac-boot-camp/pay-in-full/">Enroll — pay $479</a>
            <small>Checkout currently opens on the live production site.</small>
          </article>

          <article class="price-card">
            <p class="price-label">Monthly plan</p>
            <p class="price">$97</p>
            <p class="price-detail">$97 today, then 6 monthly payments of $97. $679 total.</p>
            <ul class="price-list"><li>Complete 27-module Boot Camp</li><li>Instructor support</li><li>Focused learning assistance</li><li>Job-search and interview preparation</li><li>OJT planning</li><li>30-day satisfaction promise</li></ul>
            <a class="button button-dark" href="https://www.hvactrainingsolutions.net/hvac-boot-camp/monthly-plan/">Start monthly plan — $97</a>
            <small>Checkout currently opens on the live production site.</small>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="center-note"><strong>Textbook:</strong> Residential Construction Academy HVAC, 2nd Edition is purchased separately.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section soft-section">
      <div class="page-shell decision-grid">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Which option should I choose?</p><h2>Choose based on cash flow—not course access.</h2><p>Both plans provide the same Boot Camp. There is no reduced version.</p></div>
        <div class="decision-cards">
          <article><strong>Choose pay in full if…</strong><p>You can pay $479 now and want the lowest total cost.</p></article>
          <article><strong>Choose monthly if…</strong><p>A $97 starting payment makes it easier to begin, even though the total is higher.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <div class="guarantee">
          <div class="guarantee-badge">30 DAY<br />PROMISE</div>
          <div><h2>Make sure Boot Camp is right for you.</h2><p>Try the course and contact HVAC Training Solutions within 30 days of purchase if it is not the right fit.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section soft-section">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <div class="section-heading center"><p class="eyebrow">Before you enroll</p><h2>Clear answers to money questions.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Does the monthly plan include the complete course?</summary><p>Yes. Both payment options include the same Boot Camp course and support.</p></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is the textbook included?</summary><p>No. Residential Construction Academy HVAC, 2nd Edition by Eugene Silberstein is purchased separately.</p></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Does enrollment guarantee an HVAC job?</summary><p>No. The course includes technical and career preparation, but employers make all hiring decisions.</p></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Why does checkout open on the current site?</summary><p>The new platform is still in development. The current production checkout remains in place until PayPal payment and automatic enrollment are fully tested and approved.</p></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Can I talk to someone before paying?</summary><p>Yes. Schedule a short, no-pressure conversation with Ron before you decide.</p></details>
        </div>
        <div class="center-actions"><a class="button button-outline-dark" href="https://www.hvactrainingsolutions.net/find-out-more/">Talk to Ron before enrolling</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section final-cta">
      <div class="page-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Still deciding?</p><h2>Try the learning experience first.</h2><p>The preview requires no payment or account.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/try-boot-camp/">Try a lesson</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/hvac-boot-camp/">Review the full course</a></div></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
